    <worksheet name='S3 Sharpe minus IHSG'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0b0b0b' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='11'>Sharpe ratio of each bank minus the IHSG&apos;s (95% interval)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#52514e' fontsize='9'>
Intervals that cross 0: no significant difference. None of the 12 does.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='sharpe_difference' name='federated.sdiff' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
            <column caption='Zero' datatype='real' name='[Zero]' param-domain-type='any' role='measure' type='quantitative' value='0.0'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='0.0' />
            </column>
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.sdiff'>
            <column caption='95% interval high' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.00;-#,##0.00' name='[ci_high]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='95% interval low' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.00;-#,##0.00' name='[ci_low]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Interval width' datatype='real' name='[ci_width]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='[ci_high] - [ci_low]' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Sharpe minus IHSG' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.00;-#,##0.00' name='[delta]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[ci_low]' derivation='None' name='[none:ci_low:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[ci_width]' derivation='None' name='[none:ci_width:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[delta]' derivation='None' name='[none:delta:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[period]' derivation='None' name='[none:period:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[ticker]' derivation='None' name='[none:ticker:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Period' datatype='string' name='[period]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Instrument' datatype='string' name='[ticker]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='false' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='axis'>
            <format attr='title' class='0' field='[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_low:qk]' scope='cols' value='Sharpe ratio minus IHSG' />
            <encoding attr='space' class='0' field='[federated.sdiff].[none:delta:qk]' field-type='quantitative' fold='true' scope='cols' synchronized='true' type='space' />
            <format attr='display' class='0' field='[federated.sdiff].[none:delta:qk]' scope='cols' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='header'>
            <format attr='display' class='0' field='[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]' scope='rows' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='label'>
            <format attr='display' field='[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='mark'>
            <encoding attr='color' field='[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]' type='palette'>
              <map to='#1baf7a'>
                <bucket>&quot;BMRI&quot;</bucket>
              </map>
              <map to='#2a78d6'>
                <bucket>&quot;BBCA&quot;</bucket>
              </map>
              <map to='#52514e'>
                <bucket>&quot;IHSG&quot;</bucket>
              </map>
              <map to='#eb6834'>
                <bucket>&quot;BBRI&quot;</bucket>
              </map>
            </encoding>
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <reference-line axis-column='[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_low:qk]' enable-instant-analytics='false' formula='average' id='refline0' label-type='none' probability='95' scope='per-table' value-column='[Parameters].[Zero]' z-order='1' />
          </pane>
          <pane id='1' selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow' x-axis-name='[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_low:qk]'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='GanttBar' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]' />
              <size column='[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_width:qk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>, </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:period:nk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>: difference </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:delta:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'> (95% interval </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_low:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'> to </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_high:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>), p = </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:p_value:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>, Holm-adjusted p = </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:p_holm:qk]>]]></run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-transparency' value='110' />
                <format attr='size' value='0.35' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
          <pane id='2' selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow' x-axis-name='[federated.sdiff].[none:delta:qk]'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Circle' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>, </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:period:nk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>: difference </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:delta:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'> (95% interval </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_low:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'> to </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:ci_high:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>), p = </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:p_value:qk]>]]></run>
                <run fontcolor='#52514e'>, Holm-adjusted p = </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Bold'><![CDATA[<[federated.sdiff].[none:p_holm:qk]>]]></run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='size' value='1.4' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>([federated.sdiff].[none:period:nk] / [federated.sdiff].[none:ticker:nk])</rows>
        <cols>([federated.sdiff].[none:ci_low:qk] + [federated.sdiff].[none:delta:qk])</cols>
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{83F689D6-5158-4404-8F2D-6A8A10968304}' />
    </worksheet>
    <worksheet name='S4 Market-implied gap'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0b0b0b' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='11'>Return not accounted for by market exposure (percentage points)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#52514e' fontsize='9'>
Actual price return minus beta x IHSG plus the risk-free rate. R3: about -23 to -29 points; R2: +15 to +66 points.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='market_implied' name='federated.implied' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
            <column caption='Zero' datatype='real' name='[Zero]' param-domain-type='any' role='measure' type='quantitative' value='0.0'>
