          <zone h='5500' id='117' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='94000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#52514e' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='8'>Historical and in-sample; not a forecast or investment advice. Price returns exclude dividends (the IHSG data has none); all returns in rupiah, no currency adjustment. The banks are part of the IHSG, so beta and R-squared are partly mechanical. Regimes: R1 to 22 Aug 2022, R2 to 17 Sep 2024, R3 to 19 May 2026, Stub to 30 Sep 2026. Full method and limitations: report/report_draft.md.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
